# 120ms rather than the 900ms animation: a buff is raised from a skill
# sequence, which paces every skill in it alike.
#
# GMS restores the HP on a hit rather than on every hit, and states no chance;
# the expectation is what an expected-damage fight can use, so it lands as a
# share of the pool every swing puts back. What it really buys a Dark Knight
# is the freedom to keep swinging while Final Pact's wait runs down.
name: "Dark Thirst"
skill_order: 1
description:
  "Channels your inner vampire to increase Attack Power and sap life from "
  "enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_DARK_KNIGHT
hyper: true
required_level: 140
max_level: 1
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 60.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 20.0
  base {
    attack: 50
    hp_recover_pct: 0.09
  }
}
